            "post_author_verified": false,
            "post_time": "5h ago",
            "post_text": "<p>I had tried traditional battery alarms before, but this plug-in design is so simple. You literally just plug it into the wall and it works. The real-time digital screen showing the exact gas levels gives me so much more confidence than a basic flashing light.</p>",
