            "post_author_verified": false,
            "post_time": "10h ago",
            "post_text": "<p>The biggest shift was how effortless the setup felt. I plugged it right into my kitchen outlet—no drilling, no wires, no electrician. It’s compact, unobtrusive, and having 4-in-1 protection delivers real peace of mind. Worth every penny.</p>",
